      "writtenOn": "2026-10-10T03:12:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not as a pre-commit or CI hook. The Redfish-first design (94472) keeps CI on lint, unit tests, and npm run build, and treats codegen as follow-on work a developer runs on purpose. Auto-fetching DMTF main would make every commit depend on the network and on whatever upstream just published. fetch-spec stays separate; npm run openapi-ts:fetch is the optional combined command.",
      "parentUuid": "3140dd8c_e06709f0",
      "revId": "4d8b8e7556d1d0ab24fdeab6b061189de3a245de",
